  },
  "description": "A 3PDT footswitch wired as true bypass, with its status LED. On: the guitar (in) goes to your circuit's input (send), your circuit's output (return) to the output jack (out), and the LED lights. Bypassed: in goes straight to out, and your circuit's input is grounded so it doesn't pop. Wiring after Coda Effects' 3PDT guide; the input grounding and the LED's 4k7 after General Guitar Gadgets' bypass options (1k to 8k2 sets how bright it is). Flip it in Knobs: Bypass.",
  "tags": [
    "bypass",
    "footswitch",
    "switching"
  ],
  "template": true,
